{"id": "245777", "name": "מציאת קבוצה שכל תת-קבוצה מקסימלית שלה היא בסיס - פולינומים עד מעלה 3", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V=\\mathbb{F}_{\\leq 3}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span>. תנו דוגמה לקבוצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\subseteq V\\)</span> כך שלכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v \\in S\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S \\setminus \\{v\\}\\)</span> היא בסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span>. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S = \\{p_1(x),p_2(x),p_3(x),p_4(x),p_5(x)\\}\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(p_1(x) =\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(p_2(x) =\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(p_3(x) =\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(p_4(x) =\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(p_5(x) =\\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הזינו פולינומים. על כל פולינום להיות במשתנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> (אקס באנגלית, אות קטנה). לדוגמה כדי להזין את הפולינום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> יש לכתוב: <code dir=\"ltr\">3*x^3 + 2*x - 7/5</code></p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "x", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "isValidVect(mat):=(is(showratvars(mat) = [x]) or is(showratvars(mat) = [])) and is(quotient(mat,x**4) = 0);\nisValidInput(lst):= if length(lst) = 5 then block(temp:map(isValidVect,lst), temp[1] and temp[2] and temp[3] and temp[4] and temp[5]) else false;\nfixVect(mat):=matrix([ev(mat,x=0)],[coeff(mat,x)],[coeff(mat,x**2)],[coeff(mat,x**3)]);\nvectorEquiv(lst):=if isValidInput(lst) then map(fixVect,lst) else [matrix([0]),matrix([0]),matrix([0]),matrix([0]),matrix([0])];\n\npAns: vectorEquiv([ans1,ans2,ans3,ans4,ans5]);", "firstnode": 1, "nodes": [{"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "isValidInput([ans1,ans2,ans3,ans4,ans5])", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך לא נכונה. אחד הוקטורים שהזנת אינו במרחב.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "4", "tans": "min(rank(addcol(pAns[1],pAns[2],pAns[3],pAns[4])),rank(addcol(pAns[5],pAns[2],pAns[3],pAns[4])),rank(addcol(pAns[1],pAns[5],pAns[3],pAns[4])),rank(addcol(pAns[1],pAns[2],pAns[5],pAns[4])),rank(addcol(pAns[1],pAns[2],pAns[3],pAns[5])))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך לא נכונה, אחת הקבוצות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S \\setminus \\{v\\} \\)</span> איננה בסיס.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}